[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Open Redirect vulnerability. This vulnerability arises when the application accepts a URL as input and redirects users to that URL without proper validation to ensure it belongs to a trusted domain. If the input URL can be manipulated by an attacker, they could redirect users to malicious sites, leading to phishing attacks or other security issues. The lack of checks to confirm that the target URL is within the specified domain allows for exploitation, as users may be unknowingly directed to harmful locations outside the intended domain.

